cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SocietyBench, please cite it as below.
title: "SocietyBench: Forecasting Counterfactual Social-World Evolution"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end benchmark for LLM and agent forecasting of real social events.
  Each event is anonymized into a counterfactual social world, entity by entity
  and date by date, and scored on two orthogonal 100-point axes: probability
  calibration and temporal accuracy.
type: software
